# Collection runs on GitHub Actions (.github/workflows/collect.yml) on
# rotating cloud egress — the home IP is Akamai-blocked for Tesco and CI
# isolates every retailer from home-IP reputation damage. This crontab only
# pulls the CI batch (whole-run idempotent; needs GITHUB_TOKEN in the
# container env, actions:read PAT) 40 minutes after the CI cron.
40 */4 * * * python -m beverage_feed pull-batch
# R5 liveness signal: log freshest observation age per retailer once daily.
# Passive (always exits 0, read-only); the line lands in supercronic logs.
5 5 * * * python -m beverage_feed freshness
